<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile receives no chromite offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile receives no chromite offers.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said Thursday it received no offers for chemical or refractory grade chromite.</p>
<p>Chromite is being offered for sale on the third Tuesday of each month. Offers are due on November 19, 1996 by 1400/1800.</p>
